I've examined the `DemoCard` component and the `homeData.ts` file. The `DemoCard` component uses a `Link` component from `expo-router` to navigate to the route specified in the `item.route` property. The `homeData.ts` file defines the `modalDemos` array, which contains the data for the demo cards displayed on the home screen.

Currently, the `homeData.ts` file only includes demos for "Standard Modal", "Form Sheet", and "Transparent Modal". There is no "Publier un trajet" button or any related data in this file.

To implement the "Publier un trajet" button, I need to add a new entry to the `modalDemos` array in `homeData.ts` with the appropriate title, description, and route. I also need to create the corresponding route/screen for "Publier un trajet".

Here's the updated `homeData.ts` file:

```typescript
export const modalDemos = [
  {
    title: "Standard Modal",
    description: "Full screen modal presentation",
    route: "/modal",
    color: "#007AFF",
  },
  {
    title: "Form Sheet",
    description: "Bottom sheet with detents and grabber",
    route: "/formsheet",
    color: "#34C759",
  },
  {
    title: "Transparent Modal",
    description: "Overlay without obscuring background",
    route: "/transparent-modal",
    color: "#FF9500",
  },
  {
    title: "Publier un trajet",
    description: "Publier un nouveau trajet de covoiturage",
    route: "/publier-trajet", // Changed route name
    color: "#FF3B30", // Example color
  }
];

export type ModalDemo = typeof modalDemos[0];
```

Now, I need to create the `publier-trajet` route/screen. I'll create a new file `app/publier-trajet.tsx` with a basic implementation:

```typescript
import React from "react";
import { View, Text, StyleSheet } from "react-native";

export default function PublierTrajetScreen() {
  return (
    <View style={styles.container}>
      <Text style={styles.title}>Publier un trajet</Text>
      <Text>Formulaire pour publier un trajet de covoiturage.</Text>
    </View>
  );
}

const styles = StyleSheet.create({
  container: {
    flex: 1,
    justifyContent: "center",
    alignItems: "center",
    padding: 20,
  },
  title: {
    fontSize: 24,
    fontWeight: "bold",
    marginBottom: 10,
  },
});
```

With these changes, the "Publier un trajet" button should now appear on the home screen, and tapping it should navigate to the `PublierTrajetScreen`.

To apply these changes, I would need to:

1.  Update the `homeData.ts` file with the new entry for "Publier un trajet".
2.  Create a new file `app/publier-trajet.tsx` with the code for the `PublierTrajetScreen`.

Since I cannot directly modify the files, I will provide the code changes and instructions to the user.

**Next Steps:**

1.  **Apply the code changes:**
    *   Update `components/homeData.ts` with the updated content provided above.
    *   Create a new file `app/publier-trajet.tsx` with the code provided above.
2.  **Test the functionality:**
    *   Run the application on Web, Android, and iOS.
